# This app owns its own database - weather history and the seasons before
# Boord. Neither belongs in the repository: the weather is re-downloadable
# and the harvest history is one farm's own records.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

.DS_Store

# Claude Code's own local state (worktrees, session config) - not shared,
# and never the same across machines.
.claude/

# The farm's own private records, kept locally for reference - not the
# app's data (see data/ above) but still never something to publish.
